<title>POLAND: Polifarb-W gives up issue before merger.</title>
<headline>Polifarb-W gives up issue before merger.</headline>
<dateline>WROCLAW, Poland 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of Polish paintmaker Polifarb Wroclaw abandoned a plan to issue new shares, paving the way for its merger with Polifarb Cieszyn, Wroclaw's president said on Friday.</p>
</text>
